<title>UK: Feb IPE gas oil delivery 558,500 tonnes - IPE.</title>
<headline>Feb IPE gas oil delivery 558,500 tonnes - IPE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical delivery against the expired IPE February gas oil futures contract will be 5,585 lots, or 585,500 tonnes, an IPE official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Deliveries against the January contract were 261,000 tonnes and 87,900 tonnes in December. Deliveries against the November contract were a record 865,100 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
</text>
